{'symbol': 'AXP', 'date': '2022-12-08 09:30:00', 'title': 'AMERICAN EXPRESS ELECTS DEBORAH P. MAJORAS TO ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS', 'text': 'NEW YORK--( BUSINESS WIRE )--AMERICAN EXPRESS COMPANY (NYSE: AXP) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT DEBORAH PLATT MAJORAS HAS BEEN ELECTED TO ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS, EFFECTIVE DECEMBER 7, 2022. MS. MAJORAS SERVED AS CHIEF LEGAL OFFICER AND CORPORATE SECRETARY OF PROCTER & GAMBLE CO. FOR 12 YEARS UNTIL HER RETIREMENT EARLIER THIS YEAR AND WAS PREVIOUSLY CHAIR OF THE FEDERAL TRADE COMMISSION FROM 2004 UNTIL 2008.'}